  {
    "id": "052dc3afc85be4d0df64",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/fighter/4/levels/18/0/d",
    "source": "When damage reduces you to 0 hit points, a reaction delays your falling unconscious and gives you an extra turn at once; during it, damage at 0 hit points still causes death save failures, and you fall unconscious when it ends if you are still at 0. Once per long rest.",
    "sourceHash": "3b0ef2a728ed6b8269848257e3e0a0bf850573dd45b99778ce17f623de7d1d75"
  },
  {
    "id": "3a9e099138f8627fe23f",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/fighter/5/desc",
    "source": "A fighter haunted by a shard of another timeline, fighting beside a grey echo of themselves.",
    "sourceHash": "fecc936b83cd03c16785dc7dcc721678c74780f1d50b5ed5ecf45e67e2d96546"
  },
  {
    "id": "708b329cb5f916241f3a",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/fighter/5/levels/3/0/n",
    "source": "Manifest Echo",
    "sourceHash": "47c2aec2ea45b94250d746407196fd8dc6f88c5c145bda1815305e4fc89085a2"
  },
  {
    "id": "cede4f2a23ebd353da80",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/fighter/5/levels/3/0/d",
    "source": "As a bonus action you manifest a gray echo of yourself in an unoccupied space within 15 feet, lasting until it is destroyed, you dismiss it, you manifest another or you are incapacitated. It has AC 14 + your proficiency bonus, 1 hit point and immunity to all conditions, uses your saving throw bonuses, and is destroyed if it ends your turn more than 30 feet from you. On your turn you can command it to move up to 30 feet without an action, swap places with it as a bonus action for 15 feet of your movement, and make any attack of the Attack action from its space; when a creature you can see within 5 feet of it moves at least 5 feet away from it, a reaction makes an opportunity attack as if you stood there.",
    "sourceHash": "88de5f50046632cb18373799708f602501b60e7de2bc6ab3255e076ac236fc9c"
  },
  {
    "id": "92a0d259d6ef6ce4a821",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/fighter/5/levels/3/1/n",
